  const PT = {"About the project":"Sobre o projeto","A visual route into a measurable relation":"Uma rota visual para uma relação mensurável","Ew2R3.org is the scientific and publication direction of the RWA® ecosystem. It develops open visualizations, calculations, papers, and testable research questions around E = ω²R³ as the worldview-correct form of Kepler’s third law.":"Ew2R3.org é a direção científica e de publicação do ecossistema RWA®. Ele desenvolve visualizações abertas, cálculos, artigos e questões de pesquisa testáveis ​​em torno de E = ω²R³ como a forma correta da visão de mundo da terceira lei de Kepler.","For bodies orbiting the same central body, Kepler’s relation above is constant. With angular velocity ω = 2π/T, the same relation is written as E = ω²R³ = 4π²R³/T².":"Para corpos que orbitam o mesmo corpo central, a relação de Kepler acima é constante. Com velocidade angular ω = 2π/T, a mesma relação é escrita como E = ω²R³ = 4π²R³/T².","The site keeps three layers distinct: observed inputs, reproducible calculations, and proposed physical interpretation. Applied engineering directions are developed separately through":"O site mantém três camadas distintas: entradas observadas, cálculos reproduzíveis e interpretação física proposta. As instruções de engenharia aplicada são desenvolvidas separadamente por meio de","and through":"e através","Read the research":"Leia a pesquisa","Contact":"Contato","Talk to the project":"Fale com o projeto","For research discussion, replication, media questions, collaboration, or corrections:":"Para discussão de pesquisa, replicação, perguntas da mídia, colaboração ou correções:","This first release intentionally uses a public email address instead of a form, so the site does not collect names or messages in its own database.":"Esta primeira versão utiliza intencionalmente um endereço de e-mail público em vez de um formulário, para que o site não colete nomes ou mensagens em seu próprio banco de dados.","Questions and boundaries":"Perguntas e limites","Where does E = ω²R³ come from?":"De onde vem E = ω²R³?","It is the worldview-correct form of Kepler’s third law expressed through angular velocity, published in 1619 — 407 years ago. For bodies orbiting the same central body, a₁³/T₁² = a₂³/T₂². Since ω = 2π/T, the same relation can be written as ω²R³ = constant; this project denotes that constant by E. The E of each central celestial body is calculated from the observed orbital parameters of other bodies orbiting it: planets for the Sun, satellites for a planet.":"É a forma da terceira lei de Kepler correta do ponto de vista da visão de mundo, expressa pela velocidade angular e publicada em 1619 — há 407 anos. Para corpos que orbitam o mesmo corpo central: a₁³/T₁² = a₂³/T₂². Como ω = 2π/T, a mesma relação pode ser escrita como ω²R³ = constante; neste projeto essa constante é indicada por E. O valor E de cada corpo celeste central é calculado a partir dos parâmetros orbitais observados de outros corpos que o orbitam: planetas para o Sol, satélites para um planeta.","What is E?":"O que é E?","E is calculated as E = ω²R³ from an observed orbit. It has units m³/s² and is numerically comparable to the conventional gravitational parameter μ = GM for the corresponding central system.":"E é calculado como E = ω²R³ de uma órbita observada. Possui unidades m³/s² e é numericamente comparável ao parâmetro gravitacional convencional μ = GM para o sistema central correspondente.","— the kilogram cancels":"- o quilograma cancela","Does the calculation use a planetary mass or G?":"O cálculo usa uma massa planetária ou G?","The operational calculation on this site uses orbital period and orbital radius. It does not require entering a mass or the universal gravitational constant.":"O cálculo operacional neste site utiliza período orbital e raio orbital. Não é necessário inserir uma massa ou a constante gravitacional universal.","Does a planet’s orbit around the Sun calculate the planet’s E?":"A órbita de um planeta em torno do Sol calcula o E do planeta?","No. That orbit primarily returns the parameter of the central Sun/two-body system. A planet’s own E is obtained from satellites orbiting that planet or another independently sourced value.":"Não. Essa órbita retorna principalmente o parâmetro do Sol central/sistema de dois corpos. O próprio E de um planeta é obtido a partir de satélites que orbitam esse planeta ou de outro valor de fonte independente.","Is the E-field visualization an observed photograph?":"A visualização do campo E é uma fotografia observada?","No. It is an interactive model derived from the project’s equations and stated visualization conventions. Observed orbital data, derived values, and proposed interpretation are labelled separately.":"Não. É um modelo interativo derivado das equações do projeto e das convenções de visualização declaradas. Os dados orbitais observados, os valores derivados e a interpretação proposta são rotulados separadamente.","Is the work peer-reviewed?":"O trabalho é revisado por pares?","The listed works are public preprints. The site does not describe them as accepted journal publications unless that status is independently confirmed.":"Os trabalhos listados são preprints públicos. O site não as descreve como publicações de periódicos aceitos, a menos que esse status seja confirmado de forma independente.","Why support an open project?":"Por que apoiar um projeto aberto?","Support funds continued visualization, documentation, reproducible calculations, translations, and independent testing. Public papers and the core model remain accessible without a paywall.":"O apoio financia visualização contínua, documentação, cálculos reproduzíveis, traduções e testes independentes. Os documentos públicos e o modelo principal permanecem acessíveis sem acesso pago.","Research":"Pesquisar","Publication programme":"Programa de publicação","Publication waves":"Ondas de publicação","The programme is organized as a sequence of research waves. Future paper titles remain private while their structure, evidence, and publication order are refined.":"O programa está organizado como uma sequência de ondas de pesquisa. Os futuros títulos de artigos permanecem privados enquanto sua estrutura, evidências e ordem de publicação são refinadas.","15 works on the horizon · 10 already have prepared research material · 3 are public preprints.":"15 trabalhos no horizonte · 10 já possuem material de pesquisa elaborado · 3 são preprints públicos.","Public preprints":"Pré-impressões públicas","Wave 1":"Onda 1","Orbital foundations":"Fundações orbitais","3 papers.":"3 papéis.","Establishes the public research baseline from orbital observations and reproducible calculations.":"Estabelece a linha de base da pesquisa pública a partir de observações orbitais e cálculos reproduzíveis.","In preparation":"Em preparação","Wave 2":"Onda 2","Fields and comparative models":"Campos e modelos comparativos","3 planned papers.":"3 artigos planejados.","Extends the programme toward field structure, celestial systems, and comparative analysis.":"Estende o programa para estrutura de campo, sistemas celestes e análise comparativa.","Research programme":"Programa de pesquisa","Wave 3":"Onda 3","Validation and laboratory programme":"Validação e programa laboratorial","3 planned works.":"3 obras previstas.","Builds the route from the research model to validation, metrology, laboratory platforms, and reproducible protocols.":"Constrói o caminho desde o modelo de pesquisa até validação, metrologia, plataformas laboratoriais e protocolos reproduzíveis.","Wave 4":"Onda 4","Scaling and rotational dynamics":"Dinâmica de escala e rotação","Connects orbital parameters with laboratory scaling, rotation, precession, and controlled experimental comparisons.":"Conecta parâmetros orbitais com dimensionamento de laboratório, rotação, precessão e comparações experimentais controladas.","Wave 5":"Onda 5","Field boundaries and theoretical synthesis":"Limites de campo e síntese teórica","Develops field boundaries and the broader theoretical synthesis while preserving explicit claim boundaries.":"Desenvolve limites de campo e uma síntese teórica mais ampla, preservando limites de reivindicações explícitas.","The number and order of future works reflect the current programme and may be refined before publication.":"O número e a ordem dos trabalhos futuros refletem o programa atual e podem ser refinados antes da publicação.","Keep the work open":"Mantenha o trabalho aberto","Support Ew2R3.org":"Apoie Ew2R3.org","Voluntary support helps maintain the visualization, publish calculations and sources, translate the material, and prepare independent tests. Support does not buy access or influence scientific conclusions.":"O apoio voluntário ajuda a manter a visualização, publicar cálculos e fontes, traduzir o material e preparar testes independentes. O apoio não compra acesso nem influencia conclusões científicas.","Support on Patreon — setup pending":"Suporte no Patreon – configuração pendente","Donate by card — next stage":"Doe por cartão – próxima etapa","Support on Patreon":"Suporte no Patreon","Donate by card":"Doe por cartão","Payment links remain disabled in this release candidate until the exact Patreon page and legal merchant route are confirmed.":"Os links de pagamento permanecem desativados neste release candidate até que a página exata do Patreon e a rota legal do comerciante sejam confirmadas.","Independent calculation":"Cálculo independente","Verify E from an orbit":"Verifique E de uma órbita","Enter an orbital period and semi-major axis. The browser calculates angular velocity and":"Insira um período orbital e um semieixo maior. O navegador calcula a velocidade angular e","without entering mass or G.":"sem inserir massa ou G.","Calculator":"Calculadora","Orbital period T":"Período orbital T","Period unit":"Unidade de período","days":"dias","hours":"horas","seconds":"segundos","Semi-major axis R":"Semi-eixo maior R","Radius unit":"Unidade de raio","metres":"metros","Calculate E":"Calcular E","Result":"Resultado","This calculation returns the E parameter of the central body or two-body system described by the orbit. It does not make E the parameter of the orbiting body.":"Este cálculo retorna o parâmetro E do corpo central ou sistema de dois corpos descrito pela órbita. Isso não faz de E o parâmetro do corpo em órbita.","Privacy":"Privacidade","Ew2R3.org is a static website. The first release does not provide accounts, comments, or a contact form.":"Ew2R3.org é um site estático. A primeira versão não fornece relatos, comentários ou formulário de contato.","Analytics":"Análise","Analytics is disabled in this release candidate until the provider, event model, consent configuration, and privacy text are approved and tested.":"A análise está desabilitada neste release candidate até que o provedor, o modelo de evento, a configuração de consentimento e o texto de privacidade sejam aprovados e testados.","Email sent to":"E-mail enviado para","is handled by the project’s email provider, not stored by this static website.":"é gerenciado pelo provedor de e-mail do projeto, não armazenado por este site estático.","Support received":"Apoio recebido","Thank you":"Obrigado","Your support helps keep the visualization, sources, and ongoing research openly available.":"Seu apoio ajuda a manter a visualização, as fontes e a pesquisa em andamento disponíveis abertamente.","Return to the visualization":"Voltar para a visualização","View research":"Ver pesquisa","Current funding.":"Financiamento atual.","RWA® group divisions supporting the programme":"Divisões do grupo RWA® que apoiam o programa","RWA® and RAILWAYAUTOMATIC® are registered trademarks. Their use without the owners’ permission is prohibited.":"RWA® e RAILWAYAUTOMATIC® são marcas registradas. É proibida a sua utilização sem a autorização dos proprietários.","As of 2026, the project is financed exclusively by the RWA® / RAILWAYAUTOMATIC® group of companies, which has supported this research direction since 2013. Voluntary donations are external support for the open visualization, translations, publications, and independent verification; they do not buy access or influence scientific conclusions.":"A partir de 2026, o projeto é financiado exclusivamente pelo grupo de empresas RWA® / RAILWAYAUTOMATIC®, que apoia esta direção de pesquisa desde 2013. As doações voluntárias são suporte externo para visualização aberta, traduções, publicações e verificação independente; eles não compram acesso nem influenciam conclusões científicas.","Google Analytics 4 is loaded only after you select “Allow” in the consent notice. If you decline, no GA4 script is loaded. Cloudflare may still process technical request data at the network edge for security, DDoS protection, and aggregate traffic operation. The site does not create advertising profiles.":"O Google Analytics 4 é carregado somente depois que você seleciona “Permitir” no aviso de consentimento. Se você recusar, nenhum script GA4 será carregado. A Cloudflare ainda poderá processar dados de solicitações técnicas na borda da rede para segurança, proteção contra DDoS e operação de tráfego agregado. O site não cria perfis publicitários."};
  const AR = {"About the project":"حول المشروع","A visual route into a measurable relation":"طريق بصري إلى علاقة قابلة للقياس","Ew2R3.org is the scientific and publication direction of the RWA® ecosystem. It develops open visualizations, calculations, papers, and testable research questions around E = ω²R³ as the worldview-correct form of Kepler’s third law.":"Ew2R3.org هو الاتجاه العلمي والنشر لنظام RWA® البيئي. يقوم بتطوير تصورات مفتوحة وحسابات وأوراق بحثية وأسئلة بحثية قابلة للاختبار حول E = ω²R³ باعتبارها الشكل الصحيح للنظرة العالمية لقانون كبلر الثالث.","For bodies orbiting the same central body, Kepler’s relation above is constant. With angular velocity ω = 2π/T, the same relation is written as E = ω²R³ = 4π²R³/T².":"بالنسبة للأجسام التي تدور حول نفس الجسم المركزي، فإن علاقة كبلر أعلاه ثابتة. مع السرعة الزاوية ω = 2π/T، يتم كتابة نفس العلاقة كـ E = ω²R³ = 4π²R³/T².","The site keeps three layers distinct: observed inputs, reproducible calculations, and proposed physical interpretation. Applied engineering directions are developed separately through":"يحتفظ الموقع بثلاث طبقات متميزة: المدخلات المرصودة، والحسابات القابلة للتكرار، والتفسير المادي المقترح. يتم تطوير الاتجاهات الهندسية التطبيقية بشكل منفصل من خلال","and through":"ومن خلال","Read the research":"اقرأ البحث","Contact":"اتصال","Talk to the project":"تحدث إلى المشروع","For research discussion, replication, media questions, collaboration, or corrections:":"لمناقشة الأبحاث أو النسخ المتماثل أو أسئلة الوسائط أو التعاون أو التصحيحات:","This first release intentionally uses a public email address instead of a form, so the site does not collect names or messages in its own database.":"يستخدم هذا الإصدار الأول عمدا عنوان بريد إلكتروني عام بدلا من النموذج، لذلك لا يجمع الموقع الأسماء أو الرسائل في قاعدة البيانات الخاصة به.","Questions and boundaries":"أسئلة وحدود","Where does E = ω²R³ come from?":"من أين تأتي E = ω²R³؟","It is the worldview-correct form of Kepler’s third law expressed through angular velocity, published in 1619 — 407 years ago. For bodies orbiting the same central body, a₁³/T₁² = a₂³/T₂². Since ω = 2π/T, the same relation can be written as ω²R³ = constant; this project denotes that constant by E. The E of each central celestial body is calculated from the observed orbital parameters of other bodies orbiting it: planets for the Sun, satellites for a planet.":"إنها الصيغة الصحيحة من منظور تصوّر العالم لقانون كبلر الثالث، معبّراً عنها بالسرعة الزاوية، وقد نُشرت سنة 1619 — أي قبل 407 أعوام. للأجسام التي تدور حول الجرم المركزي نفسه: a₁³/T₁² = a₂³/T₂². وبما أن ω = 2π/T، يمكن كتابة العلاقة نفسها على الصورة ω²R³ = ثابت؛ ويسمّي هذا المشروع ذلك الثابت E. تُحسب قيمة E لكل جرم سماوي مركزي من المعلمات المدارية المرصودة لأجرام أخرى تدور حوله: الكواكب للشمس، والأقمار للكوكب.","What is E?":"ما هو ه؟","E is calculated as E = ω²R³ from an observed orbit. It has units m³/s² and is numerically comparable to the conventional gravitational parameter μ = GM for the corresponding central system.":"يتم حساب E كـ E = ω²R³ من مدار مرصود. تحتوي على وحدات m³/s² ويمكن مقارنتها عدديًا بمعلمة الجاذبية التقليدية μ = GM للنظام المركزي المقابل.","— the kilogram cancels":"— الكيلو جرام يلغي","Does the calculation use a planetary mass or G?":"هل يستخدم الحساب كتلة كوكبية أو G؟","The operational calculation on this site uses orbital period and orbital radius. It does not require entering a mass or the universal gravitational constant.":"يستخدم الحساب التشغيلي في هذا الموقع الفترة المدارية ونصف القطر المداري. أنها لا تتطلب إدخال كتلة أو ثابت الجاذبية العالمية.","Does a planet’s orbit around the Sun calculate the planet’s E?":"هل مدار الكوكب حول الشمس يحسب E للكوكب؟","No. That orbit primarily returns the parameter of the central Sun/two-body system. A planet’s own E is obtained from satellites orbiting that planet or another independently sourced value.":"لا، هذا المدار يُرجع بشكل أساسي معلمة نظام الشمس/الجسمين المركزي. يتم الحصول على E الخاص بالكوكب من الأقمار الصناعية التي تدور حول ذلك الكوكب أو من قيمة أخرى من مصادر مستقلة.","Is the E-field visualization an observed photograph?":"هل تصور المجال الإلكتروني هو صورة فوتوغرافية ملحوظة؟","No. It is an interactive model derived from the project’s equations and stated visualization conventions. Observed orbital data, derived values, and proposed interpretation are labelled separately.":"لا، إنه نموذج تفاعلي مشتق من معادلات المشروع واتفاقيات التصور المعلنة. يتم تصنيف البيانات المدارية المرصودة والقيم المشتقة والتفسير المقترح بشكل منفصل.","Is the work peer-reviewed?":"هل يتم مراجعة العمل من قبل النظراء؟","The listed works are public preprints. The site does not describe them as accepted journal publications unless that status is independently confirmed.":"الأعمال المدرجة هي مطبوعات عامة. ولا يصفها الموقع بأنها منشورات مجلة مقبولة ما لم يتم تأكيد هذه الحالة بشكل مستقل.","Why support an open project?":"لماذا دعم مشروع مفتوح؟","Support funds continued visualization, documentation, reproducible calculations, translations, and independent testing. Public papers and the core model remain accessible without a paywall.":"استمرت أموال الدعم في التصور والتوثيق والحسابات القابلة للتكرار والترجمات والاختبارات المستقلة. تظل الأوراق العامة والنموذج الأساسي متاحين دون الحاجة إلى حظر الاشتراك غير المدفوع.","Research":"بحث","Publication programme":"برنامج النشر","Publication waves":"موجات النشر","The programme is organized as a sequence of research waves. Future paper titles remain private while their structure, evidence, and publication order are refined.":"يتم تنظيم البرنامج كسلسلة من موجات البحث. تظل عناوين الأوراق المستقبلية خاصة بينما يتم تحسين بنيتها وأدلتها وترتيب نشرها.","15 works on the horizon · 10 already have prepared research material · 3 are public preprints.":"15 عملاً في الأفق · 10 تم بالفعل إعداد مواد بحثية · 3 منها مطبوعة أولية عامة.","Public preprints":"المطبوعات العامة","Wave 1":"الموجة 1","Orbital foundations":"الأسس المدارية","3 papers.":"3 ورقات.","Establishes the public research baseline from orbital observations and reproducible calculations.":"يحدد خط الأساس للبحث العام من الملاحظات المدارية والحسابات القابلة للتكرار.","In preparation":"قيد التحضير","Wave 2":"الموجة 2","Fields and comparative models":"المجالات والنماذج المقارنة","3 planned papers.":"3 أوراق مخططة.","Extends the programme toward field structure, celestial systems, and comparative analysis.":"يمتد البرنامج نحو البنية الميدانية، والأنظمة السماوية، والتحليل المقارن.","Research programme":"برنامج البحوث","Wave 3":"الموجة 3","Validation and laboratory programme":"برنامج التحقق والمختبر","3 planned works.":"3 أعمال مخططة.","Builds the route from the research model to validation, metrology, laboratory platforms, and reproducible protocols.":"يبني الطريق من نموذج البحث إلى التحقق من الصحة والقياس ومنصات المختبرات والبروتوكولات القابلة للتكرار.","Wave 4":"الموجة 4","Scaling and rotational dynamics":"التحجيم وديناميكيات التناوب","Connects orbital parameters with laboratory scaling, rotation, precession, and controlled experimental comparisons.":"يربط المعلمات المدارية مع القياس المختبري، والدوران، والمبادرة، والمقارنات التجريبية الخاضعة للرقابة.","Wave 5":"الموجة 5","Field boundaries and theoretical synthesis":"حدود المجال والتوليف النظري","Develops field boundaries and the broader theoretical synthesis while preserving explicit claim boundaries.":"يطور حدود المجال والتوليف النظري الأوسع مع الحفاظ على حدود المطالبة الصريحة.","The number and order of future works reflect the current programme and may be refined before publication.":"يعكس عدد وترتيب الأعمال المستقبلية البرنامج الحالي ويمكن تحسينه قبل النشر.","Keep the work open":"أبقِ العمل مفتوحًا","Support Ew2R3.org":"دعم Ew2R3.org","Voluntary support helps maintain the visualization, publish calculations and sources, translate the material, and prepare independent tests. Support does not buy access or influence scientific conclusions.":"يساعد الدعم التطوعي في الحفاظ على التصور ونشر الحسابات والمصادر وترجمة المواد وإعداد الاختبارات المستقلة. الدعم لا يشتري إمكانية الوصول أو التأثير على الاستنتاجات العلمية.","Support on Patreon — setup pending":"الدعم على Patreon — الإعداد معلق","Donate by card — next stage":"التبرع بالبطاقة – المرحلة التالية","Support on Patreon":"الدعم على باتريون","Donate by card":"التبرع بالبطاقة","Payment links remain disabled in this release candidate until the exact Patreon page and legal merchant route are confirmed.":"تظل روابط الدفع معطلة في هذا الإصدار المرشح حتى يتم تأكيد صفحة Patreon الدقيقة وطريق التاجر القانوني.","Independent calculation":"حساب مستقل","Verify E from an orbit":"التحقق من E من المدار","Enter an orbital period and semi-major axis. The browser calculates angular velocity and":"أدخل الفترة المدارية والمحور شبه الرئيسي. المتصفح يحسب السرعة الزاوية و","without entering mass or G.":"دون إدخال الكتلة أو G.","Calculator":"آلة حاسبة","Orbital period T":"الفترة المدارية T","Period unit":"وحدة الفترة","days":"أيام","hours":"ساعات","seconds":"ثواني","Semi-major axis R":"المحور شبه الرئيسي R","Radius unit":"وحدة الشعاع","metres":"متر","Calculate E":"احسب ه","Result":"نتيجة","This calculation returns the E parameter of the central body or two-body system described by the orbit. It does not make E the parameter of the orbiting body.":"يُرجع هذا الحساب المعلمة E للجسم المركزي أو نظام الجسمين الموصوف بواسطة المدار. ولا يجعل E معلمة الجسم المداري.","Privacy":"خصوصية","Ew2R3.org is a static website. The first release does not provide accounts, comments, or a contact form.":"Ew2R3.org هو موقع ثابت. الإصدار الأول لا يوفر حسابات أو تعليقات أو نموذج اتصال.","Analytics":"التحليلات","Analytics is disabled in this release candidate until the provider, event model, consent configuration, and privacy text are approved and tested.":"تم تعطيل التحليلات في هذا الإصدار المرشح حتى تتم الموافقة على الموفر ونموذج الحدث وتكوين الموافقة ونص الخصوصية واختبارهما.","Email sent to":"تم إرسال البريد الإلكتروني إلى","is handled by the project’s email provider, not stored by this static website.":"تتم معالجتها بواسطة موفر البريد الإلكتروني للمشروع، ولا يتم تخزينها بواسطة موقع الويب الثابت هذا.","Support received":"تم تلقي الدعم","Thank you":"شكرًا لك","Your support helps keep the visualization, sources, and ongoing research openly available.":"يساعد دعمك في الحفاظ على التصورات والمصادر والبحث المستمر متاحًا بشكل مفتوح.","Return to the visualization":"العودة إلى التصور","View research":"عرض الأبحاث","Current funding.":"التمويل الحالي.","RWA® group divisions supporting the programme":"أقسام مجموعة RWA® الداعمة للبرنامج","RWA® and RAILWAYAUTOMATIC® are registered trademarks. Their use without the owners’ permission is prohibited.":"RWA® وRAILWAYAUTOMATIC® هما علامتان تجاريتان مسجلتان. ويحظر استخدامها دون إذن أصحابها.","As of 2026, the project is financed exclusively by the RWA® / RAILWAYAUTOMATIC® group of companies, which has supported this research direction since 2013. Voluntary donations are external support for the open visualization, translations, publications, and independent verification; they do not buy access or influence scientific conclusions.":"اعتبارًا من عام 2026، يتم تمويل المشروع حصريًا من قبل مجموعة شركات RWA® / RAILWAYAUTOMATIC®، التي دعمت هذا الاتجاه البحثي منذ عام 2013. التبرعات الطوعية هي دعم خارجي للتصور المفتوح والترجمات والمنشورات والتحقق المستقل؛ فهم لا يشترون الوصول إلى الاستنتاجات العلمية أو يؤثرون عليها.","Google Analytics 4 is loaded only after you select “Allow” in the consent notice. If you decline, no GA4 script is loaded. Cloudflare may still process technical request data at the network edge for security, DDoS protection, and aggregate traffic operation. The site does not create advertising profiles.":"لا يتم تحميل \"إحصاءات Google\" 4 إلا بعد تحديد \"السماح\" في إشعار الموافقة. في حالة الرفض، لن يتم تحميل النص البرمجي لـ GA4. قد تستمر Cloudflare في معالجة بيانات الطلب الفني على حافة الشبكة للأمان، وحماية DDoS، وتشغيل حركة المرور المجمعة. لا يقوم الموقع بإنشاء ملفات تعريف إعلانية."};
  const JA = {"About the project":"プロジェクトについて","A visual route into a measurable relation":"測定可能な関係への視覚的なルート","Ew2R3.org is the scientific and publication direction of the RWA® ecosystem. It develops open visualizations, calculations, papers, and testable research questions around E = ω²R³ as the worldview-correct form of Kepler’s third law.":"Ew2R3.org は、RWA® エコシステムの科学的および出版に関する方向性です。ケプラーの第三法則の世界観を正確に表現したものとして、E = ω²R³ に関するオープンな視覚化、計算、論文、およびテスト可能な研究課題を開発します。","For bodies orbiting the same central body, Kepler’s relation above is constant. With angular velocity ω = 2π/T, the same relation is written as E = ω²R³ = 4π²R³/T².":"同じ中心天体を周回する天体については、上記のケプラーの関係は一定です。角速度 ω = 2π/T の場合、同じ関係は E = ω²R³ = 4π²R³/T² と表されます。","The site keeps three layers distinct: observed inputs, reproducible calculations, and proposed physical interpretation. Applied engineering directions are developed separately through":"このサイトでは、観察された入力、再現可能な計算、提案された物理的解釈という 3 つのレイヤーが区別されます。応用エンジニアリングの方向性は、次のように個別に開発されます。","and through":"そしてそれを通して","Read the research":"研究を読む","Contact":"接触","Talk to the project":"プロジェクトに相談する","For research discussion, replication, media questions, collaboration, or corrections:":"研究に関する議論、複製、メディアからの質問、コラボレーション、または修正については、次のとおりです。","This first release intentionally uses a public email address instead of a form, so the site does not collect names or messages in its own database.":"この最初のリリースでは、フォームの代わりに公開電子メール アドレスを意図的に使用するため、サイトは名前やメッセージを独自のデータベースに収集しません。","Questions and boundaries":"疑問と境界線","Where does E = ω²R³ come from?":"E = ω²R³ はどこから導かれるのですか？","It is the worldview-correct form of Kepler’s third law expressed through angular velocity, published in 1619 — 407 years ago. For bodies orbiting the same central body, a₁³/T₁² = a₂³/T₂². Since ω = 2π/T, the same relation can be written as ω²R³ = constant; this project denotes that constant by E. The E of each central celestial body is calculated from the observed orbital parameters of other bodies orbiting it: planets for the Sun, satellites for a planet.":"これは角速度で表した、世界像として正しいケプラー第3法則の形であり、1619年、今から407年前に公表されました。同じ中心天体を周回する天体については a₁³/T₁² = a₂³/T₂² です。ω = 2π/T なので、同じ関係は ω²R³ = 定数 と書けます。本プロジェクトではこの定数を E と表します。各中心天体の E は、その周囲を回る別の天体の観測軌道パラメータから計算します。太陽では惑星、惑星では衛星を用います。","What is E?":"Eとは何ですか？","E is calculated as E = ω²R³ from an observed orbit. It has units m³/s² and is numerically comparable to the conventional gravitational parameter μ = GM for the corresponding central system.":"E は、観測された軌道から E = ω²R³ として計算されます。単位は m3/s2 で、数値的には対応する中心系の従来の重力パラメータ μ = GM に匹敵します。","— the kilogram cancels":"— キログラムはキャンセルされます","Does the calculation use a planetary mass or G?":"計算には惑星の質量または G が使用されますか?","The operational calculation on this site uses orbital period and orbital radius. It does not require entering a mass or the universal gravitational constant.":"当サイトの運用計算では、軌道周期と軌道半径を使用しています。質量や万有引力定数を入力する必要はありません。","Does a planet’s orbit around the Sun calculate the planet’s E?":"太陽の周りの惑星の軌道は惑星の E を計算しますか?","No. That orbit primarily returns the parameter of the central Sun/two-body system. A planet’s own E is obtained from satellites orbiting that planet or another independently sourced value.":"いいえ。その軌道は主に太陽/二天体系の中心のパラメータを返します。惑星自体の E は、その惑星を周回する衛星、または別の独立した値から取得されます。","Is the E-field visualization an observed photograph?":"電界の可視化は観察された写真ですか?","No. It is an interactive model derived from the project’s equations and stated visualization conventions. Observed orbital data, derived values, and proposed interpretation are labelled separately.":"いいえ。これは、プロジェクトの方程式と明示された視覚化規則から派生した対話型モデルです。観測された軌道データ、導出された値、提案された解釈は個別にラベル付けされています。","Is the work peer-reviewed?":"その作品は査読されていますか?","The listed works are public preprints. The site does not describe them as accepted journal publications unless that status is independently confirmed.":"掲載されている作品は公開されているプレプリントです。このサイトでは、そのステータスが独自に確認されない限り、それらを受理されたジャーナル出版物として説明しません。","Why support an open project?":"なぜオープンプロジェクトをサポートするのでしょうか?","Support funds continued visualization, documentation, reproducible calculations, translations, and independent testing. Public papers and the core model remain accessible without a paywall.":"継続的な視覚化、文書化、再現可能な計算、翻訳、独立したテストに資金を提供しました。公開論文とコアモデルには、ペイウォールなしで引き続きアクセスできます。","Research":"研究","Publication programme":"出版プログラム","Publication waves":"出版の波","The programme is organized as a sequence of research waves. Future paper titles remain private while their structure, evidence, and publication order are refined.":"このプログラムは、一連の研究ウェーブとして構成されています。今後の論文のタイトルは非公開のままですが、その構造、証拠、出版順序は改良されます。","15 works on the horizon · 10 already have prepared research material · 3 are public preprints.":"15 件の研究が予定されています。10 件はすでに研究資料が準備されています。3 件は公開プレプリントです。","Public preprints":"公開プレプリント","Wave 1":"ウェーブ 1","Orbital foundations":"軌道基盤","3 papers.":"紙3枚。","Establishes the public research baseline from orbital observations and reproducible calculations.":"軌道観測と再現可能な計算から公的研究のベースラインを確立します。","In preparation":"準備中","Wave 2":"ウェーブ 2","Fields and comparative models":"フィールドと比較モデル","3 planned papers.":"予定論文は3本。","Extends the programme toward field structure, celestial systems, and comparative analysis.":"プログラムをフィールド構造、天体システム、比較分析に拡張します。","Research programme":"研究プログラム","Wave 3":"ウェーブ 3","Validation and laboratory programme":"検証および実験室プログラム","3 planned works.":"予定作品は3本。","Builds the route from the research model to validation, metrology, laboratory platforms, and reproducible protocols.":"研究モデルから検証、計測、実験室プラットフォーム、再現可能なプロトコルへのルートを構築します。","Wave 4":"ウェーブ 4","Scaling and rotational dynamics":"スケーリングと回転ダイナミクス","Connects orbital parameters with laboratory scaling, rotation, precession, and controlled experimental comparisons.":"軌道パラメータを実験室のスケーリング、回転、歳差運動、および制御された実験比較と関連付けます。","Wave 5":"ウェーブ 5","Field boundaries and theoretical synthesis":"フィールドの境界と理論的総合","Develops field boundaries and the broader theoretical synthesis while preserving explicit claim boundaries.":"明示的なクレームの境界を維持しながら、分野の境界とより広範な理論的総合を開発します。","The number and order of future works reflect the current programme and may be refined before publication.":"今後の作品の数と順序は現在のプログラムを反映しており、出版前に改良される可能性があります。","Keep the work open":"作業を開いたままにしておく","Support Ew2R3.org":"Ew2R3.org をサポートする","Voluntary support helps maintain the visualization, publish calculations and sources, translate the material, and prepare independent tests. Support does not buy access or influence scientific conclusions.":"自主的なサポートは、視覚化の維持、計算とソースの公開、資料の翻訳、独立したテストの準備に役立ちます。サポートはアクセスを購入したり、科学的結論に影響を与えたりするものではありません。","Support on Patreon — setup pending":"Patreon でのサポート — セットアップ保留中","Donate by card — next stage":"カードで寄付する — 次のステージ","Support on Patreon":"Patreonでのサポート","Donate by card":"カードで寄付する","Payment links remain disabled in this release candidate until the exact Patreon page and legal merchant route are confirmed.":"正確な Patreon ページと合法的な販売者のルートが確認されるまで、このリリース候補では支払いリンクは無効のままです。","Independent calculation":"独自計算","Verify E from an orbit":"軌道から E を検証する","Enter an orbital period and semi-major axis. The browser calculates angular velocity and":"軌道周期と長半径を入力します。ブラウザは角速度を計算し、","without entering mass or G.":"マスやGを入力せずに。","Calculator":"電卓","Orbital period T":"公転周期 T","Period unit":"期間単位","days":"日","hours":"時間","seconds":"秒","Semi-major axis R":"長半径R","Radius unit":"半径単位","metres":"メートル","Calculate E":"Eを計算する","Result":"結果","This calculation returns the E parameter of the central body or two-body system described by the orbit. It does not make E the parameter of the orbiting body.":"この計算により、軌道によって記述される中心天体または二体系の E パラメータが返されます。 E を周回体のパラメータにするわけではありません。","Privacy":"プライバシー","Ew2R3.org is a static website. The first release does not provide accounts, comments, or a contact form.":"Ew2R3.org は静的な Web サイトです。最初のリリースでは、アカウント、コメント、お問い合わせフォームは提供されません。","Analytics":"分析","Analytics is disabled in this release candidate until the provider, event model, consent configuration, and privacy text are approved and tested.":"このリリース候補では、プロバイダー、イベント モデル、同意構成、およびプライバシー テキストが承認およびテストされるまで、分析は無効になっています。","Email sent to":"メール送信先","is handled by the project’s email provider, not stored by this static website.":"この静的 Web サイトでは保存されず、プロジェクトの電子メール プロバイダーによって処理されます。","Support received":"サポートを受けました","Thank you":"ありがとう","Your support helps keep the visualization, sources, and ongoing research openly available.":"皆様のご支援は、ビジュアライゼーション、ソース、進行中の研究をオープンに利用できる状態に保つのに役立ちます。","Return to the visualization":"ビジュアライゼーションに戻る","View research":"研究を見る","Current funding.":"現在の資金調達。","RWA® group divisions supporting the programme":"プログラムを支援するRWA®グループ部門","RWA® and RAILWAYAUTOMATIC® are registered trademarks. Their use without the owners’ permission is prohibited.":"RWA® および RAILWAYAUTOMATIC® は登録商標です。所有者の許可なくそれらを使用することは禁止されています。","As of 2026, the project is financed exclusively by the RWA® / RAILWAYAUTOMATIC® group of companies, which has supported this research direction since 2013. Voluntary donations are external support for the open visualization, translations, publications, and independent verification; they do not buy access or influence scientific conclusions.":"2026 年の時点で、このプロジェクトは、2013 年からこの研究の方向性をサポートしてきた RWA® / RAILWAYAUTOMATIC® 企業グループによって独占的に資金提供されています。自発的な寄付は、オープンな視覚化、翻訳、出版、および独立した検証に対する外部サポートです。彼らはアクセスを購入したり、科学的結論に影響を与えたりしません。","Google Analytics 4 is loaded only after you select “Allow” in the consent notice. If you decline, no GA4 script is loaded. Cloudflare may still process technical request data at the network edge for security, DDoS protection, and aggregate traffic operation. The site does not create advertising profiles.":"Google アナリティクス 4 は、同意通知で「許可」を選択した場合にのみ読み込まれます。拒否すると、GA4 スクリプトはロードされません。 Cloudflareは、セキュリティ、DDoS保護、および集約トラフィック操作のために、ネットワークエッジで技術的なリクエストデータを処理する場合があります。このサイトは広告プロフィールを作成しません。"};
